        "text": "Official course grading, assignments, interactive feedback, and university credentials remain restricted to enrolled degree students via CMU Online"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        28
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 7549,
        "endIndex": 7629,
        "text": "High-value educational access story from a top-tier computer science institution"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        25
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 7730,
        "endIndex": 8004,
        "text": "**What is confirmed:** Microsoft issued a preliminary incident post-mortem attributing the major November 12–14 global outage (which disabled Exchange Online, Outlook, Teams, and Copilot) to a latent software bug introduced in a July 2026 update to network gateway servers"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        29,
        30
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 8006,
        "endIndex": 8126,
        "text": "This defect triggered internal connection failures and caused server capacity to become unresponsive under traffic loads"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        30
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 8130,
        "endIndex": 8257,
        "text": "**Important caveats:** Microsoft confirmed there is no evidence that the outage was caused by a cyberattack or malicious breach"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        30,
        31
      ]
    },
    {
